title: OptionExpressions
---
<<declare $price = 7>>
<<declare $name = "tea">>
-> Buy {$name} for {$price} #line:buy
    Purchased. #line:purchased
-> Sell {$name} for {$price - 2} <<if false>> #line:sell
    Sold. #line:sold
===

title: CommandExpressions
---
<<give "{$name}" {$price + 1} {true}>>
<<wait 1>>
===

title: Numbers
---
{round_places(2.5, 0)} {round_places(-3.5, 0)} {round_places(3.125, 2) == 3.12} {random_range_float(1.5, 1.5)} #line:numbers
===

title: SmartVariables
---
<<declare $double_price = $price * 2>>
<<declare $expensive = $double_price > 15>>
{$double_price} {$expensive} #line:smart_before
<<set $price = 9>>
{$double_price} {$expensive} #line:smart_after
===

title: Saliency
---
<<declare $eligible = false>>
{has_any_content("Offer")} {has_any_content("NoOffer")} {has_any_content("Numbers")} {has_any_content("Missing")} #line:availability
<<detour Offer>>
<<set $eligible = true>>
<<detour Offer>>
=> Chosen. <<if $eligible>> #line:chosen
=> Not chosen. <<if not $eligible>> #line:not_chosen
===
title: Offer
subtitle: Ordinary
when: not $eligible
---
Ordinary offer. #line:ordinary
===
title: Offer
subtitle: Special
when: $eligible
---
Special offer. #line:special
===
title: NoOffer
subtitle: Unavailable
when: false
---
Unavailable. #line:unavailable
===
title: Fairness
---
<<detour Cycle>>
<<detour Cycle>>
===
title: Cycle
subtitle: First
when: always
---
First item. #line:cycle_first
===
title: Cycle
subtitle: Second
when: always
---
Second item. #line:cycle_second
===
title: Enums
---
<<enum Food>>
    <<case Apple>>
    <<case Orange>>
<<endenum>>
<<declare $food = Food.Apple>>
{$food == Food.Apple} {$food != Food.Orange} #line:enums_before
<<set $food = Food.Orange>>
{$food == Food.Apple} {$food != Food.Orange} #line:enums_after
===

title: Strings
---
<<declare $greeting = "">>
<<declare $index = 0>>
<<set $greeting = $name + "!">>
-> {$greeting + " buy"} #line:string_option
    {$greeting} {string($price)} {number("12.5") == 12.5} {bool("TrUe")} #line:string_values
<<set $greeting = $greeting + " again">>
{$greeting} #line:string_after
===
title: StringStress
---
<<set $greeting = "">>
<<set $index = 0>>
<<jump StringLoop>>
===
title: StringLoop
---
<<set $greeting = $greeting + "x">>
<<set $index += 1>>
<<if $index < 32>>
    <<jump StringLoop>>
<<endif>>
{$greeting} #line:string_stress
===
title: Expressions
---
<<declare $n = 0 as number>>
<<declare $b = false as bool>>
<<declare $s = "salt" as string>>
<<declare $counter = 0 as number>>
<<set $n = (3 + 4) * 2 - 10 / 4>>
<<set $b = $n > 10 and not ($s == "wake") or false>>
<<set $s = "wake">>
<<set $n = $n % 5 + min(9, 2) + max(-1, 1) + round(2.5) + round(3.5) + floor(-1.5) + ceil(1.2) + inc(2) + dec(2.5) + int(-3.7) + decimal(4.25)>>
Result: {$n} {$b} {$s} #line:expr_result
===
title: Visits
---
<<detour Helper>>
<<detour Helper>>
Visits: {visited_count("Helper")} {visited("Visits")} {visited("Helper")} #line:visits_line
<<jump VisitsEnd>>
===
title: Helper
---
Helper: inside #line:helper_inside
===
title: VisitsEnd
---
End: {visited_count("Visits")} #line:visits_end
===
title: ParityStart
---
Narrator: A branching parity check. #line:p_01
<<set $counter = 2>>
<<if $counter * 3 == 6 and visited("ParityStart") == false>>
    Narrator: Arithmetic and visited agree. #line:p_02
<<endif>>
-> First road #line:p_opt1
    <<detour ParityDetour>>
    Narrator: Back from the detour. #line:p_03
-> Second road <<if $counter > 5>> #line:p_opt2
    Narrator: Unreachable. #line:p_04
-> Third road #line:p_opt3
    <<sync_cmd 3>>
    <<jump ParityEnd>>
Narrator: Fell through to the end. #line:p_05
<<jump ParityEnd>>
===
title: ParityDetour
---
Narrator: Inside the detour, counter is {$counter}. #line:p_06
-> Only choice <<once>> #line:p_opt4
    Narrator: Once only. #line:p_07
-> Other choice #line:p_opt5
    Narrator: Other. #line:p_08
===
title: ParityEnd
---
Narrator: Visited start {visited_count("ParityStart")} detour {visited_count("ParityDetour")}. #line:p_09
<<if visited("ParityDetour")>>
    Narrator: The detour left a mark. #line:p_10
<<else>>
    Narrator: No detour taken. #line:p_11
<<endif>>
===
title: Modulo
---
Modulo: {11.5 % 5} {12.5 % 5} {5.5 % 2.5} #line:modulo_even
Signs: {-7.5 % 2} {-7 % 3} {7 % -3} #line:modulo_signs
===
